{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 2004Z  Supermarket Income REIT PLC  16 October 2026   16 October 2026SUPERMARKET INCOME REIT PLC(the \"Company\")Grant of 2026 LTIP awardsNotification and public disclosure of transactions by PDMRsSupermarket Income REIT plc LSE:SUPR, announces that it has granted awards in the form of n…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 2004Z  Supermarket Income REIT PLC  16 October 2026   ",{"type":"p","children":["16 October 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["SUPERMARKET INCOME REIT PLC"]},{"type":"p","children":["(the \"Company\")"]},{"type":"p","children":["Grant of 2026 LTIP awards"]},{"type":"p","children":["Notification and public disclosure of transactions by PDMRs"]},{"type":"p","children":["Supermarket Income REIT plc ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"LSE:SUPR","text":"LSE:SUPR"}},", announces that it has granted awards in the form of nominal cost options (\"Awards\") over ordinary shares of the Company of £0.01 each (\"Shares\") pursuant to its Long Term Incentive Plan (the \"LTIP\"), on 14 October 2026 to the Executive Directors in the following table. Awards take the form of Performance Share Awards (\"PSAs\") and Deferred Share Bonus Awards (\"DSBAs\"), as set out below."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Director"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Type of Award"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Number of Shares under"]},{"type":"p","children":["Award"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Rob Abraham"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["PSA"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["1,197,530"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Mike Perkins"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["PSA"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["876,543"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Rob Abraham"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["DSBA"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["249,480"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Mike Perkins"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["DSBA"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["182,952"]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"p","children":["PSAs"]},{"type":"p","children":["The exercise price for each PSA is £0.01 per Share, being the nominal cost of a Share. Vesting of the PSAs is subject to continued service and satisfaction of performance conditions relating to the following metrics:"]},{"type":"p","children":["(i)          Relative Total Shareholder Return (\"TSR\") measured against the constituents of the FTSE 350 Real Estate sector excluding agencies (50% weighting). 25% of this part of an award will vest for median TSR, increasing pro-rata to 100% of this part of an award vesting for upper quartile TSR as measured from 1 July 2026 to the date of publication of results for the 2029 financial year;"]},{"type":"p","children":["(ii)          EPRA earnings per share (\"EPS\") performance for the 2029 financial year (25% weighting). 25% of this part of an award will vest for the 2029 financial year EPS of 6.37p increasing pro-rata to 100% of this part of an award vesting for the 2029 financial year EPS of 7.05p; and"]},{"type":"p","children":["(iii)        Total accounting return (\"TAR\") during the 2027, 2028 and 2029 financial years (25% weighting). 25% of this part of an award will vest for TAR of 5% p.a. increasing pro-rata to 100% of this part of an award vesting for TAR of 10% p.a.."]},{"type":"p","children":["In addition to the performance conditions outlined above, the Remuneration Committee will retain discretion to adjust any formulaic outcome for the PSAs if it considers it necessary to take account of its broader assessment of Company or executive performance and the stakeholder experience more generally over the vesting period."]},{"type":"p","children":["The vesting date of the PSAs will be the date of publication of results for the 2029 financial year."]},{"type":"p","children":["A holding period of two years from the date of vesting applies to the PSAs granted to the Executive Directors (and any Shares resulting from the PSAs)."]},{"type":"p","children":["DSBAs"]},{"type":"p","children":["The exercise price for each DSBA is £0.01 per Share, being the nominal cost of a Share. The DSBAs relate to the deferral of 50% of the annual bonus for the 2026 financial year, which would otherwise be paid in cash, into options over Shares with a future vesting date conditional upon continued employment."]},{"type":"p","children":["The vesting date of the DSBAs will be the second anniversary of the grant date."]},{"type":"p","children":["Notifications made in accordance with the requirements of Article 19 of the UK Market Abuse Regulation."]},{"type":"p","children":["The following notifications are made in accordance with the requirements of Article 19 of the UK Market Abuse Regulation."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["1"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":4},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["Details of the person discharging managerial responsibilities/persons"]},{"type":"p","children":["closely associated"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data